==French==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|fr}} "during hour" (cognate with Italian {{term|ancora}})

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɑ̃.kɔʁ/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|fr-encore.ogg|Audio (France)}}

===Adverb===
{{infl|fr|adverb}}

# [[still]]
#: ''Vous êtes '''encore''' là?''
#:: Are you '''still''' here?
# [[more]]
#: ''Voulez-vous '''encore''' du [[pain]]?''
#:: Would you like '''more''' [[bread]]?
#: ''Tu en veux '''encore'''?''
#:: You want some '''more'''?
# [[again]]
#: '''''Encore''' une fois.''
#:: Once '''again'''.
# [[yet]]
#: ''Je n'ai pas encore fini.''
#:: I didn't finish '''yet'''

